          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak bunjin koigeny konetisioni eng’ okwek: oming’inge eng’ arawetab tisab, eng’ betutab taman ne bo arawanato, amat oyai boisiet age tugul, inendet ne kisikyin ga, anan bunotyot ne mi kobotok: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu kiyaiywok kagaigaet betunoto, kitililok; ak otililitu anyun eng’ tengekwogikwok eng’ taitab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Betunoto ko sabato ne bo kamuung’et eng’ okwek, ak oming’inigei; nito ng’atutiet ne bo koigeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koyai kagaigaet tisiindet ne kiili, ne kitororjin boisietab tililindo, ne igeeri kwandanyi, ak kolaach ngoroikab katanit, ngoroichoto itabanotin: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak koyai kagaigaet agobo got ne tilil, ak koyai kagaigaet agobo emait ne kituiyechin ak kaptisisiet; ak koyai kagaigaet agobo tisiik ak bik tugul che bo tuiyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak egu nito ng’atutiet ne bo koigeny eng’ okwek, keyai kagaigaet agobo lagokab Israel konyil agenge eng’ kenyit, amu tengekwogikwak tugul. Kiyai anyun inendet ko u ye king’at Jehovah Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
